AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000387> "point group is a quality of a crystal that defines its symmetry consisting strictly of rotations, reflections, and inversions around a fixed center"@en)
