AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000406> "Point group type is a categorical value specification of a point group. It includes all the 32 point groups."@en)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000406> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001930>)


